# MS-11k: repo-wide LF pin (anchor reproducibility root-cure).
# Git for Windows defaults autocrlf=true -> fresh clones check out CRLF,
# which go:embed embeds raw (bundle pollution, same-size/different-hash
# anchors — the 56DC6ABA incident). eol=lf forces LF working trees in ANY
# clone form; starter set = embed-relevant faces (static/* wildcard embeds
# html/js/css/svg; *.svg and the lightning stub gaps were found by the MS-11k
# decisive-clone experiment; woff2 fonts are binary-auto-detected, never
# converted; go.mod/go.sum proved build-output-neutral by experiment).
*.go text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
# embedded as-is by //go:embed (internal/lightning/embed.go): must stay
# byte-exact blob. CRLF smudge (+1B "\r") both drifts the build AND breaks
# the "placeholder\n" sentinel (HasEmbedded false-positive). binary macro
# = -text: no EOL conversion ever; safe if ever swapped for the real
# lightning ELF binary.
internal/lightning/tidb-lightning binary
